        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin 6963 Traditional Rope Mortise Bristol Handleset with 5104 Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Bristol Handleset features a classic rope design both along the edges of the plates and on the ornate 5104 Lever. It is available in an array of finishes including lifetime polished brass, aged brass, venetian bronze, and satin nickel. The 6963 Baldwin Bristol Door Entrance Set will fit 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" door thicknesses and with backsets of 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\". This ornate handleset is available as a dummy, a single cylinder, and a double cylinder handleset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMortise locks have been, and still are, the established norm for Europe and much of the rest of the world. In the early 1960’s Baldwin brought residential mortise locks to America. They ‘founded’ the residential mortise industry and continue to be the leader – so much so that their competitors have bought Baldwin locks for their own homes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also Available: Matching <a href=\"/products/rope-leverset-baldwin-5104\"><b>Baldwin 5104 Rope Leverset</b></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Traditional 6963 Bristol Door Entrance Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Accessibility Code (ADA) A117.1</li>\r\n<li>Solid forged brass for maximum strength and durability.</li>\r\n<li>Heavy duty steel mortise lock body for a lifetime of trouble-free operation.  </li>\r\n<li>Mortise locks have adjustable forged brass lock fronts, protected by armored scalp fronts for ultimate strength and protection against tampering.</li>\r\n<li>Forged brass and steel mechanical.</li>\r\n<li>Locks and strikes fit standard ANSI A115.1 preparation.</li>\r\n<li>Reinforced steel security strike with three inch screws.</li>\r\n<li>Anti friction latch bolt with 3/4” throw.  </li>\r\n<li>1” throw deadbolt has two hardened steel inserts for maximum protection and security.</li>\r\n<li>7mm hub broached on the diamond</li>\r\n<li>Certified by Underwriters Laboratories (UL) for use on fire doors up to three-hour rating.</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime Limited Warranty</b> on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Ornate Estates Collection Bristol Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Interior Trim: 5104 Lever</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Length: 15.9\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Width: 3.4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Thickness:  .375\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Exterior Projection: 2.6\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Length: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 2.75\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Thickness: .375\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Interior Projection: 2.4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Hub to Turn Piece Length: 2.25\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Hub to Cylinder Length: 3.437\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" or 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset:  2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-6963.pdf?v=1691094972\" target=\"new\"><b>Bristol Handleset Specification Sheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-estate_mortise_dimensions.pdf?v=1691094972\" target=\"new\"><b>Mortise Box Specification Sheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a key unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Ornate Bristol Mortise Handleset, Baldwin 6963",
                "description": "Baldwin 6963 Bristol Handleset - The Bristol Handleset features a classic rope design both along the edges of the plates and on the ornate 5104 Lever. It is available in an array of finishes including lifetime polished brass, aged brass, venetian bronze, and satin nickel. The 6963 Baldwin Bristol Door Entrance Set will fit 1-3/8 inch or 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses and with backsets of 2-1/2 inches or 2-3/4 inches. This ornate handleset is available as a dummy, a single cylinder, and a double cylinder handleset.\r\n",
                "keywords": "BAL-6963, baldwin 6963 Bristol handlesets, baldwin Bristol door entrance sets, single cylinder handlesets, double cylinder handlesets, emergency egress handlesets,  Bladwin ornate Estate Collection Handlesets, ornate handlesets, rope handlesets, Traditional handlesets, ADA compliant levers,"
